    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"Umeed Aur Roshni\"  (Hope and Light), final-year BScN students Afaq Alam, Fatiha Naz, and Hira Bulbul from the Aga Khan University (AKU) collaborated with the Paediatrics and Oncology Unit to redefine care for children with cancer and their families.",
